ctrl_high,cx002579,"Given an integer n, return true if it is a power of three. Otherwise, return false.

An integer n is a power of three, if there exists an integer x such that n == 3^x.","Given an integer n, find a way to confirm it is a power of three. If confirmed, return true. If not, return false.

An integer n is a power of three if there exists an integer x such that n == 3^x.",6,0.0,0,0,,
